flowchart TD
  S([Open app]) --> B[Browse tab: list of upcoming events]
  B --> Q{Looking for<br/>something specific?}
  Q -- Yes --> F[Search and/or set filters:<br/>category, date, location, organizer]
  F --> B
  Q -- No --> T[Tap an event card]
  T --> D[Event details: date, time, venue,<br/>organizer, how to join]
  D --> C{Event cancelled?}
  C -- Yes --> N[Read organizer's notice<br/>RSVP disabled]
  C -- No --> A{Action}
  A -- Save --> SV[Bookmark added → Saved tab]
  A -- Interested / Going --> RV[RSVP recorded → Saved tab filters]
  SV --> E([Done])
  RV --> E
  N --> E
